docs {
  Admin moderates the leftover Kafka-canary listing — first takedown (with
  reason), then re-approve. Adds 2 distinct action types to the audit log
  alongside the verification approves/rejects from Phase04.

  Net audit-log diversity after Demo runs:
    - VERIFICATION_APPROVED (×2)
    - VERIFICATION_REJECTED (×1)
    - LISTING_TAKEDOWN
    - LISTING_APPROVED  (re-approval is also captured)
}
